.SH NAME
std::mdspan::empty \- std::mdspan::empty

.SH Synopsis
constexpr bool empty() const noexcept;  (since C++23)

Check if the mdspan is empty.

.SH Parameters

\fI(none)\fP

.SH Return value

true if the size of the multidimensional index space extents() is 0, otherwise false.

